{"insertText":{"location":{"index":173102,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"\nThis appendix reports the per-seed results, the supplementary analyses listed in Chapter 3 under Statistical Treatment of Data, and the results with horizontal-flip test-time augmentation for RQ1 (Tables J1 to J8 and Figure J1). None of these analyses was used to decide a hypothesis."}},
